sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Player
    participant Web as Browser game
    participant API as Game API / relayer
    participant Sui as Sui Move canonical state
    participant Prover as Private ZK prover
    participant G16 as Native Sui Groth16

    Player->>Web: Select registered binary warrant
    Web->>API: Request warrant(session, predicate, nonce)
    API->>Sui: Authorize safe pending query
    Note over Sui: Check known predicate; no pending action; unused predicate;<br/>disclosures < 5; both non-empty branches retain ≥ 2 candidates;<br/>correct session and nonce

    alt Unsafe query, replay, sixth query, or invalid session/nonce
        Sui-->>API: Reject without disclosure
        API-->>Web: Fail closed — no certified answer
    else Safe pending query authorized
        Sui-->>API: PendingQuery authorization
        API->>Prover: Private witness + committed case + typed predicate
        Note over Prover: Proof binds case commitment, registered typed predicate,<br/>result bit, session, and query nonce
        Prover-->>API: Groth16 proof + public inputs
        API->>Sui: Submit proof-backed transition
        Sui->>G16: Verify expected key, proof, and bound inputs

        alt Invalid proof or replayed transition
            G16-->>Sui: Invalid
            Sui-->>API: Abort; canonical state unchanged
            API-->>Web: No disclosure
        else Proof valid
            G16-->>Sui: Valid
            Sui->>Sui: Update candidate mask, disclosure count, nonce, PendingQuery
            Sui-->>API: Executed transaction effects
            API->>API: Wait for confirmed execution / finality
            alt Confirmation or finality missing
                API-->>Web: Withhold certified result
            else Confirmed
                API-->>Web: Certified result + updated candidate count
                Web-->>Player: Render YES or NO only
            end
        end
    end
